  "description": "OBEGUB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C34 H60 Gd4 N8 O24,20(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd_12 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd_13 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.621-4.060 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.70-114.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C34H60Gd4N8O24·20H2O. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
